    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d83">

                <pb facs="0243" n="183" sameAs="frus:frus1961-63v17/pg183"/>

                <head>83. Memorandum From President Kennedy to His Special Assistant for National Security Affairs
                        (Bundy)<anchor n="0"
                        xml:id="d83-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1961-07-10">July 10,
                    1961</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I want a report from the State Department, I asked Secretary Rusk about this, on whose idea it was for me to
                    send the letters to the Middle Eastern Arab leaders.<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d83-f2"/> The reaction has been so sour I would like to know whose
                    idea it was, what they hoped to accomplish and what they think we have now
                    accomplished.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold"
                            >JFK</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
